{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2334400/extras/d26f839dc6835da6de2cc576e0b56617.poster.avif?t=1770816320\" width=1040 height=222 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2334400/extras/d26f839dc6835da6de2cc576e0b56617.webm?t=1770816320\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2334400/extras/d26f839dc6835da6de2cc576e0b56617.mp4?t=1770816320\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Tale of LUMI</strong> is a 2D action game inspired by <strong>metroidvania</strong> classics. You play as <strong>Atlas</strong> on his journey to restore the fallen Kingdom of <strong>LUMI</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect <strong>GODLY POWERUPS</strong>, battle <strong>POWERFUL</strong> enemies, solve <strong>INTRIGUING</strong> puzzles, <strong>UPGRADE</strong> your abilities, and <strong>EXPLORE</strong> and <strong>RESTORE</strong> the fallen Kingdom of <strong>LUMI!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2334400/extras/49d7909ef50bf0cc643f64d574d99d2a.avif?t=1770816320\" width=1041 height=131 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2334400/extras/101a1454159e7b7b0cf65a94a8d04c30.poster.avif?t=1770816320\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2334400/extras/101a1454159e7b7b0cf65a94a8d04c30.webm?t=1770816320\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2334400/extras/101a1454159e7b7b0cf65a94a8d04c30.mp4?t=1770816320\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ruined Kingdom of <strong>LUMI</strong> was once a powerful land that kept the connection between all worlds safe. The <strong>LUMI</strong> themselves were the embodiment of hope. Then, during the <strong>Total Eclipse</strong>, the <strong>Nightbringers</strong> summoned the primordial God <strong>Khaos</strong> from eternal slumber, bringing the once-mighty Kingdom to ruins. <strong>EXPLORE</strong> the fallen Kingdom and all its secrets \u2014 unlock the entire map by interacting with the <strong>POWERFUL</strong> entities that dwell within.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2334400/extras/2acbb1d0570e98206e63f1700395defe.avif?t=1770816320\" width=1041 height=131 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2334400/extras/4c4348b02dd399dddbec4848fcbd2a93.poster.avif?t=1770816320\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2334400/extras/4c4348b02dd399dddbec4848fcbd2a93.webm?t=1770816320\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2334400/extras/4c4348b02dd399dddbec4848fcbd2a93.mp4?t=1770816320\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2334400/extras/6244f69c8805446c82a345f643b87421.avif?t=1770816320\" width=1041 height=130 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress through the game, you will collect <strong>GODLY POWERUPS</strong>. These <strong>GODLY POWERUPS</strong> grant you unique abilities to solve puzzles, navigate through the map, and face challenging enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2334400/extras/a528db17867c79d1af13f128b71fac61.poster.avif?t=1770816320\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2334400/extras/a528db17867c79d1af13f128b71fac61.webm?t=1770816320\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2334400/extras/a528db17867c79d1af13f128b71fac61.mp4?t=1770816320\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrades are essential as <strong>Atlas</strong> ventures deeper into the fallen Kingdom of <strong>LUMI</strong>. <strong>UPGRADE</strong> and <strong>ENHANCE</strong> your <strong>GODLY POWERUPS</strong> to face the trials brought by the <strong>Nightbringers</strong> and <strong>Khaos</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2334400/extras/1a40ac8b7c1b656c3c7ead4817241276.avif?t=1770816320\" width=1232 height=404 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2334400?t=1770816320","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2334400/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770816320","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2334400/051d849d08fc357c1e22d569b98a599b22fbdc09/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770816320","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2334400/051d849d08fc357c1e22d569b98a599b22fbdc09/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770816320","categorie