16320\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2334400/extras/101a1454159e7b7b0cf65a94a8d04c30.webm?t=1770816320\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2334400/extras/101a1454159e7b7b0cf65a94a8d04c30.mp4?t=1770816320\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ruined Kingdom of <strong>LUMI</strong> was once a powerful land that kept the connection between all worlds safe. The <strong>LUMI</strong> themselves were the embodiment of hope. Then, during the <strong>Total Eclipse</strong>, the <strong>Nightbringers</strong> summoned the primordial God <strong>Khaos</strong> from eternal slumber, bringing the once-mighty Kingdom to ruins. <strong>EXPLORE</strong> the fallen Kingdom and all its secrets \u2014 unlock the entire map by interacting with the <strong>POWERFUL</strong> entities that dwell within.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2334400/extras/2acbb1d0570e98206e63f1700395defe.avif?t=1770816320\" width=1041 height=131 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2334400/extras/4c4348b02dd399dddbec4848fcbd2a93.poster.avif?t=1770816320\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2334400/extras/4c4348b02dd399dddbec4848fcbd2a93.webm?t=1770816320\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2334400/extras/4c4348b02dd399dddbec4848fcbd2a93.mp4?t=1770816320\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn